<view class="page">
  <view class="card intro"><view class="title">月度学习归档</view><view class="muted">每个月是一段独立周期：记录、复盘与附件索引都留在同一个文件夹里。</view></view>
  <view class="card cloud-card {{cloudStatus.state==='offline'?'cloud-offline':''}}"><view><view class="backup-title">{{cloudStatus.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{cloudStatus.message}}</view></view><button size="mini" bindtap="checkCloud">检测连接</button></view>
  <view class="archive-filter" bindtap="chooseArchiveSource">资料来源筛选：{{archiveSource}} · 点击切换</view>
  <view class="card weekly-review-card"><view class="backup-title">本周学习复盘</view><view class="muted">统计最近 7 天本机学习数据，先看节奏，再决定下周重点。</view><view class="review-grid"><view class="review-metric"><text class="review-number">{{weeklyReview.plan.percent}}%</text><text>计划完成</text></view><view class="review-metric"><text class="review-number">{{weeklyReview.totalMinutes}}</text><text>专注分钟</text></view><view class="review-metric"><text class="review-number">{{weeklyReview.streak}}</text><text>连续复习</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{weeklyReview.plan.total}}" class="muted">本周完成 {{weeklyReview.plan.completed}} / {{weeklyReview.plan.total}} 个新建任务</view><view wx:if="{{weeklyReview.weakTopics.length}}" class="weak-box"><view class="weak-title">建议优先复盘</view><view wx:for="{{weeklyReview.weakTopics}}" wx:key="name" class="weak-item"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.dueCount}} 条已到期</text></view></view><view wx:else class="muted">本周还没有到期薄弱项，继续把新错题放入复盘队列。</view><button size="mini" class="copy-summary weekly-report" bindtap="copyWeeklyReport">复制本周报告</button></view>
  <view class="card reminder-card"><view><view class="backup-title">复习提醒</view><view class="reminder-title">{{reminderState.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{reminderState.message}}</view><view class="subscription-status">微信订阅提醒：{{reminderState.subscription}} · 云端定时推送需恢复云开发并配置模板</view></view><button wx:if="{{reminderState.dueCount}}" size="mini" class="go-review" bindtap="goReview">去复盘</button></view>
  <view class="card source-card"><view class="backup-title">知识来源目录</view><view class="muted">只引用公开课程链接或你自己保存的资料，不保存未授权教材全文。</view><view wx:for="{{knowledgeSources}}" wx:key="id" class="source-row"><view class="source-main"><view class="source-subject">{{item.subject}}</view><view class="source-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.topics}}</view><view class="source-usage">{{item.usage}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{item.url}}" size="mini" class="copy-source" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="copySource">复制链接</button><text wx:else class="source-local">由资料卡补充</text></view></view>
  <view class="card weekly"><view class="backup-title">近 7 天专注看板</view><view class="weekly-total">{{weeklyStats.totalMinutes}} 分钟</view><view class="muted">横轴是日期，纵轴是当天专注时长；只统计有归属的本机专注记录。</view><view class="bar-chart"><view wx:for="{{weeklyStats.daily}}" wx:key="start" class="bar-column"><text class="bar-value">{{item.minutes}}</text><view class="bar-track"><view class="bar-fill" style="height: {{item.height}}%"></view></view><text class="bar-label">{{item.label}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{weeklyStats.subjects.length}}" class="subhead">按科目分配</view><view wx:for="{{weeklyStats.subjects}}" wx:key="name" class="metric-row"><view class="metric-top"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.minutes}} 分钟 · {{item.percent}}%</text></view><view class="metric-track"><view class="metric-fill" style="width: {{item.percent}}%"></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{weeklyStats.tasks.length}}" class="subhead">按具体任务分配</view><view wx:for="{{weeklyStats.tasks}}" wx:key="name" class="metric-row"><view class="metric-top"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.minutes}} 分钟 · {{item.percent}}%</text></view><view class="metric-track task-track"><view class="metric-fill task-fill" style="width: {{item.percent}}%"></view></view></view></view>
  <view class="card backup"><view class="backup-title">本机数据备份</view><view class="muted">云同步恢复前，建议定期复制完整备份，保存到 Obsidian 或自己的文件里。</view><view class="backup-status {{localSafety.needsBackup?'backup-warning':''}}">{{backupStatus.text}}</view><view class="safety-text">未保存原件 {{localSafety.unsavedFiles}} 个 · 超过 10MB {{localSafety.oversizedFiles}} 个</view><view class="backup-actions"><button size="mini" class="copy-summary" bindtap="copyBackup">复制完整备份</button><button size="mini" class="copy-obsidian" bindtap="exportBackupFile">生成并转发文件</button><button size="mini" class="restore-toggle" bindtap="toggleRestore">{{showRestore ? '收起恢复' : '恢复备份'}}</button></view><block wx:if="{{showRestore}}"><button size="mini" class="preview-backup" bindtap="chooseBackupFile">选择备份文件</button><textarea class="backup-input" value="{{backupText}}" placeholder="粘贴此前复制的完整备份 JSON" maxlength="-1" auto-height bindinput="setBackupText"></textarea><button size="mini" class="preview-backup" bindtap="previewRestore">预览备份内容</button><view wx:if="{{backupPreview}}" class="backup-preview">备份包含：{{backupPreview.tasks}} 项任务 · {{backupPreview.records}} 条记录 · {{backupPreview.reviews}} 条复盘 · 专注 {{backupPreview.focusMinutes}} 分钟</view><button size="mini" class="restore-confirm" bindtap="confirmRestore">恢复并覆盖本机数据</button></block></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!folders.length}}" class="card empty">还没有可归档的学习内容。</view>
  <block wx:for="{{folders}}" wx:key="key">
    <view class="card folder">
      <view class="folder-head" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="toggleFolder"><view><view class="month">📁 {{item.label}}</view><view class="muted">学习记录 {{item.recordCount}} 条 · 复盘 {{item.reviewCount}} 条 · 任务 {{item.taskCount}} 项</view></view><text>{{open[item.key]?'收起':'展开'}}</text></view>
      <block wx:if="{{open[item.key]}}">
        <view class="export-actions"><button size="mini" class="copy-summary" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="copySummary">复制本月摘要</button><button size="mini" class="copy-obsidian" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="copyObsidian">复制到 Obsidian</button></view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.tasks.length}}" class="subhead">任务</view>
        <block wx:for="{{item.tasks}}" wx:for-item="task" wx:key="id"><view class="entry"><view class="entry-meta">{{task.subject || '未分类'}} · {{task.statusLabel}}</view><view>{{task.done ? '✓ ' : ''}}{{task.title}}</view></view></block>
        <view wx:if="{{item.records.length}}" class="subhead">学习记录</view>
        <block wx:for="{{item.records}}" wx:for-item="record" wx:key="id"><view class="entry"><view class="entry-meta">{{record.displayDate}} · {{record.subject || '未分类'}}</view><text wx:if="{{record.title}}" class="record-title selectable" user-select>{{record.title}}</text><text wx:if="{{record.content}}" class="selectable" user-select>{{record.content}}</text><view wx:if="{{record.clipboardText}}" class="record-actions"><text class="copy-text" data-text="{{record.clipboardText}}" catchtap="copyRecordText">复制文字</text><text class="copy-text manage-text" data-record="{{record}}" catchtap="manageRecord">管理</text></view><view wx:if="{{record.images.length}}" class="thumbs"><image wx:for="{{record.images}}" wx:for-item="image" wx:key="*this" src="{{image}}" mode="aspectFill" data-image="{{image}}" data-images="{{record.images}}" bindtap="previewRecordImage"/></view><view wx:for="{{record.files}}" wx:for-item="file" wx:key="attachmentId" class="archive-file {{file.status==='needs_source'?'file-unavailable':''}}" data-file="{{file}}" bindtap="fileActions">📎 {{file.name}} · {{file.status==='needs_source'?'原件未保存':'打开 / 转发'}}<text wx:if="{{file.status==='needs_source'}}" class="file-reason">{{file.reason}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!record.content && !record.title && !record.images.length && !record.files.length}}">图片或文件附件记录</view></view></block>
        <view wx:if="{{item.reviews.length}}" class="subhead">复盘条目</view>
        <block wx:for="{{item.reviews}}" wx:for-item="review" wx:key="id"><view class="entry"><view class="entry-meta">{{review.displayDate}} · {{review.type || '未分类'}}</view><view>{{review.content}}</view></view></block>
      </block>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
